#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Cold Aura (on)" to
#. "COLD_AURA_OFF"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
msgid "You suppress your frozen powers."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Split"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body and soul were split in half, and part of it were left inside the "
"ley-line, connected with your main body with tiniest, ethereal thread.  In "
"danger situation, you will abandon your main body and turn back into copy, "
"with all knowledge and skills you have."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
