#. "MIND_READ_OFF"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
msgid "You suppress your mind abilities."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Soul Pressure"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
