#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
msgid "Skin tone: blue"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Skin tone: blue"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
msgid "You have a sky- or sea-colored skin tone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
msgid "Skin tone: green"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Skin tone: green"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
msgid "You have a green skin tone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
msgid "Skin tone: gray"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Skin tone: gray"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
msgid "You have a gray skin tone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
msgid "Skin tone: midnight"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Skin tone: midnight"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
msgid "You have an almost pure black skin tone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
msgid "Skin tone: opal"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Skin tone: opal"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
msgid ""
"You have an opalescent skin tone, pale with a faint shimmering rainbow of "
"colors."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
msgid "Skin tone: red"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Skin tone: red"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
msgid "You have a reddish or very ruddy skin tone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Blood Mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
msgid ""
"Animists are known for their blood magic, and being a Biomancer you are able to take it another step further by strengthening your blood.  The dark arts have opened to you, and while dangerous, are incredible to behold.\n"
"\n"
"Ichor: Your Blood Mage abilities grant you the ability to steal some health from your enemies from time to time, and immunity to bleeding."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Boreal Mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
msgid ""
"Named for the auroras that grace the poles of the earth, the Boreal mage specializes in auras that protect ethereally.  Boreal mages definitely know their way around cold spells, but their real strength is protection.\n"
"\n"
"Boreal Wind: Your Boreal Mage abilities grant you good resistance to temperature conditions.  Also, your hands emit a small amount of cold, increasing your damage in melee."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cleansing Flame"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
msgid ""
"The Cleansing Flame is the fire that burns away the chaff, in preparation for the regrowth of new life.\n"
"\n"
"Cleansing Blaze: Your Cleansing Flame abilities grant you good resistance to temperature conditions.  You are also immune to infection, as your body cleanses every tainted part of you, constantly."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Earth Elemental"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
msgid ""
"Stone is superior to flesh.  You have allowed this axiom into your life, and work to correct your own weakness with biomancy.  The strength of the Earth rushed up to meet you with open arms.\n"
"\n"
"Earth Creep: Your Earth Elemental body grant you good resistance against cut damage, total immunity to electricity, great strength, and colossal stamina."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fire Elemental"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
msgid ""
"You have used your expertise in Biomancy to change your body more toward your affinity for fire as a Kelvinist.  Fire doesn't bother you as much anymore, and your blood is flammable when it touches the air, resulting in a gout of flame when something hurts you.  You are also starting to study more spells that focus on using your own body's affinity for fire.\n"
"\n"
"Salamander: Your Fire Elemental abilities grant you good resistance to temperature conditions and heat damage.  Also, your body emits streams of blistering heat towards anyone who attacks you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Message in effect "FIRE_ELEMENTAL_BURNBACK"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
msgid "Flame and heat flash out from where you've been hit."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC message in effect "FIRE_ELEMENTAL_BURNBACK"
#. ~ NPC message in effect "integrated_coal_skin_burnback"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/integrated_armor_spells.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's body jets fire and heat out from the wound."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Force Mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
msgid ""
"Force = Mass x Acceleration.  This is the typical thing that people think of nowadays when the word is used, but Force Mages have a different meaning, coming from traditional roots: untyped magical damage appears to be a ghostly \"force.\"  This might be the effect of the attunement, but the cause is even more intriguing: they appear to turn Newton's Third Law on its head.  Magical scholars of the 21st century have theorized that this isn't really the case; instead of the opposite reaction happening on this plane of existence, a Force Mage uses the Aetherium's alternate Laws to rebound the force back upon itself, effectively doubling the force in the same direction instead.  However this ability comes with limitations, as the Force Mage can only do this for melee damage.\n"
"\n"
"Motion: Your Force Mage abilities grant you better speed, and increased damage in melee."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Gaia's Chosen"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
msgid ""
"The Champion of the Earth, Gaia's Chosen is blessed on all things nature, animate and inanimate.\n"
"\n"
"Gaia's Champion: Your Gaia's Chosen abilities grant you a larger HP pool, and enemies have a chance to impale themselves upon your thorns when they attack you.  However, the thorns growing from your skin means you feel pain more acutely."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Message in effect "GAIAS_CHOSEN_THORNS"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
msgid "Thorns tear at your opponent as they strike you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC message in effect "GAIAS_CHOSEN_THORNS"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's thorny brambles bite into their attacker."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Glacier Mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
msgid ""
"The power of a Glacier Mage is backed by a thousand tons of ice and snow, with a brutal might in their spells.  While they are skilled with cold spells, their greatest strength is in offense.\n"
"\n"
"Stalactite: Your Glacier Mage abilities grant you good resistance to temperature conditions, and enemies are often hurt when try to attack you in melee."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Golemancer"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
msgid ""
"The Golemancer is the ancient myth of the clay golem, made reality from constant use of Animist summons and Earthshaper self-strengthening spells.  Takes some traits from the golems they create, such as immunity to slowing effects.\n"
"\n"
"Clay: Your Golemancer abilities make you perfectly steady, as nothing can slow you down.  Your body also deflects some of the damage you take."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Gravity Mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
msgid ""
"The fundamental Laws of the universe are thought of as the end-all-be-all in magical circles, and the Gravity Mage is a result of mages mucking around with those laws.  Unfortunately, this attunement does not give supreme control over gravity as a fundamental force, though the affinity is prominent and comes with some non-negligible benefits.\n"
"\n"
"Weight: Your Gravity Mage abilities increase your attack speed and melee damage for a bit, double your ability to carry weight, and allow you to climb without using ladders or support."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ice Elemental"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
msgid ""
"Through your power in Biomancy, you have changed your body towards your Kelvinist affinity for ice.  Extreme cold has less effect on you, and your superchilled skin causes frostbite when touching others.  You're also starting to research more magic that focuses on your body's inherent ice affinity.\n"
"\n"
"Iceberg: Your Ice Elemental abilities grant you good resistance to temperature conditions and cold damage, your hands can emit small amount of cold, increasing your damage in melee, and enemies impale themselves on ice spikes when they attack you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Magnetism Mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
msgid ""
"This attunement grants you a magical control over the forces of magnetism.\n"
"\n"
"Power: Your Magnetism Mage abilities grant you a good defense against firearms, perfect electric immunity, and the ability to see electric creatures from any distance."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Permafrost Mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
msgid ""
"This attunement focuses on continuously freezing foes to death.\n"
"\n"
"Blizzard: Your Permafrost Mage abilities grant you good resistance to temperature conditions.  Also, enemies who attack you may find themselves frozen solid."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Shaman"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
msgid ""
"Deeply attuned to the spiritual fabric that shapes and nurtures the natural world, shamans call upon the primeval spirits of nature for aid and advice.  Be careful however, for ancient spirits are fickle and unknowable things.\n"
"\n"
"Spirits: Your Shaman abilities double your natural mana regeneration."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Soulfire"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
msgid ""
"The Soulfire is a phenomena of the caster's spirit binding to a fragment of a spirit of flame.  This makes it possible for the Soulfire to use its namesake as an element - much like fire, it does burn, but it burns away at the soul instead of the flesh.\n"
"\n"
"Spirit Flames: Your Soulfire abilities grant you good resistance to temperature conditions.  Your hands also emit the purest of blazes, which increases your damage in melee."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Storm Elemental"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
msgid ""
"You've used your knowledge of Biomancy to change your body into a form befitting a Stormshaper.  You can better withstand the power of electricity, and sparks leap from your skin when something hits you.  You're beginning to study spells that utilize your body's affinity for the electric.\n"
"\n"
"Cyclone: Your Storm Elemental abilities grant you total electric immunity, and reflective zippers to anyone who tries to attack you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Message in effect "STORM_ELEMENTAL_ZAPBACK"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
msgid "Electricity arcs out from where you've been hit."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC message in effect "STORM_ELEMENTAL_ZAPBACK"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's body arcs electricity from the wound."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sun Mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
msgid ""
"The Sun Mage has been studying the Laws governing heat, and has attained a special relationship with that life-giving yellow orb in the sky.  Glimpses of the Sun meet its foes, and its own burning light pierces the darkness.\n"
"\n"
"Solar Warrior: Your Sun Mage abilities blind everyone who are mean to you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Message in effect "solar_blinding"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
msgid "A brilliant light radiates from where you've been hit."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC message in effect "solar_blinding"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's body is enveloped in a bright glare."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Tundra Mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
msgid ""
"The barren cold of the world's far reaches flows through the Tundra Mage.  They find power in the all-pervasive frost of the North and in the creatures that defy its deathly chill.\n"
"\n"
"Arctic: Your Tundra Mage abilities grant you good resistance to temperature conditions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Void Mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
msgid ""
"Where there is nothing, there is still power, and the Void Mages embody that power.  The ability to wield emptiness itself is at their fingertips, and no living creature can withstand the call of the void.\n"
"\n"
"Drainer: Your Void Mage abilities grant you perfect night vision, and envenom everyone you attack."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vulcanist"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
msgid ""
"One of the most destructive forces on earth, a Volcano Mage takes some aspect of its namesake.  Their spells tend to be a little slow, but their resilience in proximity to a volcano is legendary.\n"
"\n"
"Lava: Your Vulcanist abilities grant you good resistance to temperature conditions, total heat immunity, and immunity to smoke."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Wither Mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
msgid ""
"While biomancers focus on both life and death; Wither Mages set their sights on the transitional period between these two stages.  They wield entropy and decay hand and hand, using it to enhance their combat prowess to surgical precision.  This confluence of abilities are what lead to assassin mages gaining this attunement.\n"
"\n"
"Fading: Your Wither Mage abilities grant you the ability to consume the enemies powers for a short time."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Kelvinist"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/classes.json
msgid ""
"Disciples of the great Archwizard Lord Kelvin.  Kelvinists focus their magic "
"on manipulation and control of the temperature of their environment, leading "
"to spectacularly powerful explosions or bone-chilling cold.  Your powers "
"grant you some immunity from fire that increases with your skills."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Stormshaper"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/classes.json
msgid ""
"Stormshapers follow ancient arcane disciplines of meditation and harmony with"
" the winds and tides that shape the planet.  Through their deep connection to"
" these forces, they can request powerful changes.  Your powers grant you some"
" immunity from electricity that increases with your skills."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Black Dragon Scales"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
msgid ""
"Your skin has grown thick and a set of draconic black scales has grown to "
"cover most of your body, acting as natural armor.  Greatly reduces wet "
"effects."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
msgid "Reptilian Legs"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Reptilian Legs"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
msgid ""
"Your legs and feet have become reptile-like and your toenails have grown into"
" short claws.  Fortunately they don't impede your movement."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
msgid "Dragon Legs"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dragon Legs"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
msgid ""
"Your legs and feet have become dragon-like and the claws on your toes have "
"developed into incredibly tough talons.  These are fearsome and powerful, but"
" prevent you from wearing shoes and slightly impede your movement."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Dragon Legs" attacks
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#, c-format
msgid "You slash %s with your clawed feet!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "Dragon Legs" attacks
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s slashes %2$s with their clawed feet!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
msgid "Dragon Horns"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dragon Horns"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
msgid ""
"You have a pair of long, curved back, dragon-like horns.  They allow you to "
"make a strong bashing headbutt attack, but prevent wearing headwear that is "
"not made of fabric."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Dragon Horns" attacks
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#, c-format
msgid "You headbutt %s with your draconic horns!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "Dragon Horns" attacks
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s headbutts %2$s with their draconic horns!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Black Dragon Wings"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
msgid ""
"You have a pair of large, black scaled dragon wings.  While you have control "
"of them and can make attacks with them, they are not large enough nor strong "
"enough to allow you to fly and they throw you off balance, greatly reducing "
"your ability to dodge.  They can be used to cast a protective spell on "
"yourself however."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Black Dragon Wings" attacks
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#, c-format
msgid "You bash %s with your powerful wings!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "Black Dragon Wings" attacks
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s bashes %2$s with their powerful wings!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Draconic Magic"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
msgid ""
"You are imbued with the ancient magic powers of dragons, improving your mana "
"reserves and opening your mind to amazing feats of magic."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
msgid "Stubby Dragon Tail"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
msgid "Short Dragon Tail"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Short Dragon Tail"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
msgid ""
"You have a short, dragonlike tail.  You can use it decently as a club of "
"sorts, but it's not doing anything to help you balance.  Prevents wearing "
"non-fabric pants."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
msgid "Draconic Predator"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Draconic Predator"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
msgid ""
"You have become something more than human.  Something better - and far, far "
"worse.  Combat skills are easy to learn and maintain, and unlike lesser "
"predators, your mental faculties don't suffer at all."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
msgid "Draconic Apex Predator"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Draconic Apex Predator"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
msgid ""
"Your mind and brain have fully adapted to your new place at the top of the "
"magical food chain.  You can effortlessly master and maintain combat skills, "
"and your malevolent intellect only grows."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
msgid "Draconic Acid Immunity"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Draconic Acid Immunity"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
msgid ""
